I'm playing 3.1.1 in discovery mode, and was wondering what to wish for now
that I have the Wand of Wishing.  Actually, I've already used it up (& have
recharged it) but can still wrest 1 more wish out of it.  Some of the things
of use I already have:
blessed luckstone & bag of holding, Stormbringer & Demonbane, GDSM, shield
of reflection, helm of brilliance, speed boots, dexterity gauntlets, plenty
of enchant armor & weapon scrolls, ring of levitation, Bell of Opening, 
Master Key of Thievery, unicorn horn, gallons of holy water, & tons of
spellbooks.
I'm also level 30 & have 18/** strength, so spinach & gain level potions
are out.  Any ideas what I should wish for next?

BTW, here's a spoiler on how to get free wishes in discover mode:

It's really quite easy.  Whenever you come upon a throne, save the game
before sitting on it.  Then get back in the game (remember to keep the save
file!) and #sit until something interesting happens.  If it's good, save 
the game from there & repeat; if it's bad, quit the game there (and identify
the items you have while you're at it), restart, & repeat.  In theory, you
can get as many wishes as you have the patience for, although I've only
wrested about 4 or 5 out of thrones.
I think there's some other applicable ways to get wishes as well, though I'm
not sure what they are.
You can also guarantee that a wraith will leave a corpse by saving before 
you kill it and using this same method.
